config NFC_PN553_DEVICES
	bool "NXP NQ3xx (PN553 family) NCI protocol driver (I2C) devices"
	depends on I2C && OPPO_NFC
	help
	  Character device driver (/dev/pn553) for NXP NQ310/NQ330 NFC
	  controllers, used by the NXP NFC HAL. Probes only when the
	  project's NFC chipset (OPPO_NFC) is one of them.
